OL,3,GNEWSAVandal-hit former care home may be
OL,4,Arazed for flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vacant former care home that became a
OL,7,Fhotspot for vandalism and rough
OL,8,Fsleeping could be demolished to make
OL,9,Fway for new flats.
OL,11,FThe city council wants to knock down
OL,12,FBlakenhall Resource Centre on Haggar
OL,13,FStreet, in Wolverhampton, to build a
OL,14,Fthree-storey building containing 30
OL,15,Fflats.
OL,17,FThe facility, which was once used as a
OL,18,Fcare home, shut in 2020 after a series
OL,19,Fof break-ins and vandalism attacks,
OL,20,Fwith its dementia services moving to
OL,21,Fthe city's West Park.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
