OL,3,GNEWSAVandal-hit former care home may be
OL,4,Arazed for flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site was declared "surplus to
OL,7,Frequirements" by City of Wolverhampton
OL,8,FCouncil in 2023 and listed for sale as
OL,9,Fpart of a community asset transfer deal
OL,10,Fto local organisations, which said it
OL,11,Fwould be sold if a suitable tenant was
OL,12,Fnot found.
